    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφρουρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>watching with</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαθρον ξύμφρουρον ἐμοί</span> the
			chamber <i>that keeps watch with</i> me, i.e. <i>in which I lie
				sleepless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1453
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Thess. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφρουρος, ὁ</span>, <i>joint</i><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φρουρός,
				Ἀρχ. Ἐφ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				1911.124
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gonni</span>); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμπρουρος</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).1058
			</span></i> (pl., Mopsium).</div>
